@sheet Data [json]
[
  { "day": "2026-02-01", "hours": 6, "active": true },
  { "day": "2026-02-02", "hours": 7, "active": false },
  { "day": "2026-02-03", "hours": 2, "active": true }
]

@sheet Summary
-Metric-Value-
| Hours | =SUM(Data!hours) |
| Peak | =MAX(Data!hours) |
| First day | =Data!A2 |

@sheet Review
-Metric-Value-
| Carry | =Summary!B2 |
| Peak copy | =Summary!B3 |
